{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\外崎家リビング.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Look, <STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, how about this dolly?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"My, my, my! And what about this picture book, then?" [TN: he speaks a heavy regional dialect.]
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"............"</STYLE><PG>
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>, it's about time for your bath."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"In with Grandpa, then!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I can take it by myself."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="1">Natsumi</STYLE>... what's the matter with her, I wonder? She's usually so much more cheerful..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Cherry blossoms out already, are they?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, <STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> said she'd be fine as long as she stays out of the wind..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Is that so..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\なつみ子供.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="1">"Hey, Grandpa, Grandma."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Hm? What is it?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Grown-ups... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">why don't they help the people they want to help?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"Why did </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE><STYLE ID="1"> leave me behind?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="1">　I wanted to help them..."</STYLE><PG>
"That's... 
{PAUSE ""}
well, your <STYLE ID="3">dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">mom</STYLE> have all sorts of things going on too..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">"I'm going to take my bath."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "0" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"<STYLE ID="2">Akane</STYLE> and the others... what happened to them, I wonder?"<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
